# =============================================================
# 根级 .gitignore — 覆盖整个仓库
# =============================================================

# ===== 本地工具 / 二进制 =====
.redis/

# ===== Maven（后端） =====
**/target/
*.class

# ===== Node / 前端 =====
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ===== 上传目录（运行期生成） =====
forum-server/uploads/
**/uploads/

# ===== 凭据：含真实账号密码的环境配置，禁止入仓 =====
**/application-dev.yml
**/application-prod.yml
**/application-local.yml
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# ===== IDE =====
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
.project
.classpath
.settings/

# ===== OS =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===== 日志与临时 =====
logs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*~

# ===== Agent 会话级临时文件 =====
.context/
